    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Why this matters</h1>
    <p class="kicker text-slate-600">A 60-second read on what the school-trust experiment teaches the architects of the next century's intergenerational trusts.</p>

    <figure class="my-8">
      <img
        src="/img/hero/hero_v1_2026-05-06.png"
